 hunk)

No trimming drops a posting or a pay paragraph (the user's no-cut rule).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014jaqot5Ddmi7Co6CofBiyc
